# e2e/ MUST stay in the build context. tsconfig.json includes `**/*.ts`, so
# `next build` type-checks e2e/global-setup.ts, which imports ./mock-llm,
# ./mock-license-validator and ./mock-midtrans. Excluding the directory made the
# build fail with "Cannot find module './mock-midtrans'" even though the file was
# present in git. Playwright RUN ARTIFACTS are still excluded above, which is what
# this rule was originally for. Only 72K; the app itself never imports e2e/.
